                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Look, this game SUCKS. I've spent 16 hours trying to finish this game, and I'm only 61% done. Why? Cause the RNG of the puzzles is complete SH*T! The RNG of what gems are placed into the puzzles is terrible. You will experience \"NO MORE MOVE\" and have the gems reset, only to have 1 or 2 auto complete from the reset, then get a \"NO MORE MOVE\" yet again, and be stuck in this endless cycle of not being able to complete the puzzle in time. I've been stuck on 1 puzzle for 3 hours straight because of this bullsh*t. Combine that with some of the worst \"levels\" you have to complete make it even more of a nightmare to play, that only get worse and worse the further you get into the game. The store page only shows you the easiest level, and for a reason. Combine that with the worst menus ever (that don't even work for the most part).\n\nI've tried my best to complete this game, but I can't. I've only played this game while doing other tasks like watching YouTube, but that can only go so far when the game sucks sh*t.\n\nThis game is not fun. It's not worth it for the achievement spam. It's an asset flip as well, so f*ck it even more!\n\n[h1] DO NOT BUY THIS TRASH! DEATH TO ACHIEVEMENT SPAM ASSET FLIP GARBAGE! [/h1]",
